<title>UK: UK clears Pearson buy of Putnam Berkley.</title>
<headline>UK clears Pearson buy of Putnam Berkley.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Trade and Industry said on Wednesday it would not refer Pearson Plc's acquisition of U.S. publisher Putnam Berkley Inc. to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission.</p>
<p>Pearson said in November last year it was buying Putnam Berkley for $336 million from MCA Inc, the entertainment arm of Canada-based Seagram Co.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
